---
Run health checks on installed extensions

Usage: specforge doctor [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --path <PATH>
          Path to the project root
          
          [default: .]

      --format <FORMAT>
          Output format: human or json
          
          [default: human]
          [possible values: human, json]

  -h, --help
          Print help
